<title>USA: Whittman-Hart accelerates expansion.</title>
<headline>Whittman-Hart accelerates expansion.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittman-Hart Inc said Monday it added two cities -- Grand Rapids, Mich. and Peoria, Ill. -- to its previously announced 1997 branch expansion plans.</p>
<p>The company, which provides information technology consulting and system integration services, said its new facilities become its ninth and tenth branch operations. A previously announced Atlanta branch is to open during the third quarter.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
